# 👋 Onboarding & Welcome Guide

Welcome to the **Golden Glades Middle School** team! Whether you are joining us as instructional faculty, support staff, or school administration, your role is vital in maintaining a safe, realistic, and engaging educational roleplay environment. 

This guide serves as your initial roadmap to understand our core identity, complete essential day-one requirements, navigate our technical systems, and fulfill daily operational expectations.

---

## 1. Welcome & School Identity

### Leadership Greeting
On behalf of the administration, welcome to Golden Glades Middle School. Our staff team thrives on mutual respect, professional collaboration, and operational excellence. As a staff member, you represent our school's vision in every class period, administrative session, and community interaction. We hold our leadership and faculty to high standards to ensure every student and player experiences top-tier educational roleplay.

### Mission Statement
Our mission is to cultivate a supportive and inclusive learning environment where every student in every grade is empowered to academic success and personal growth. Through a diverse curriculum handpicked by our teachers and reviewed by our admin, we strive to ignite curiosity, foster creativity, and prepare our students to become thoughtful, responsible, and engaged individuals in this world.

### Vision Statement
Our vision is to be a middle school where innovation and tradition meet, creating an environment that inspires students to reach their full potential. We aim to be a beacon of excellence in our community, known for nurturing resilient leaders who lead with integrity, embrace diversity, and possess the skills needed to thrive in their future.

### Mottos & Slogan
Golden Glades Middle operates under a defined visual and cultural identity designed to foster leadership and team unity across all departments:

* **Motto:** *"Where Future Leaders Strive"*
* **Slogan:** *"Empowering Leaders. Inspiring Excellence."*

### School Overview
Golden Glades Middle is a structured, 8-building virtual campus environment serving academic grade levels **5th through 8th grade**, alongside dedicated **Special Education (SPED)** instruction. Our operational vision balances realistic educational workflows—such as scheduled subject rotations, structured lesson plans, and real-time student tracking—with interactive community roleplay.

