## 2. Quick-Start Onboarding Checklist

Complete the following action items on your first day as a staff member:

1. **Access the Staff Website:** Navigate to [staff.goldengladesms.org](https://staff.goldengladesms.org) and bookmark it as your central operational hub.
2. **Review Required Policy Docs:** Thoroughly read through the **Staff Code of Conduct**, **Classroom Management Protocols**, and **Staff Evaluation Guidelines**.
3. **Confirm Shift / Schedule:** Verify your assigned subject period (Science, Culinary Arts, English, Theatre, Gym, History, Art, or Speech & Debate) or your administrative coverage assignment.
4. **Setup Discord Permissions:** Ensure your server nicking, role tags, and department access are correctly assigned in the official Discord server.

