## 5. Operations & Support Structure

### Leadership Directory

| Position | Contact / Focus Area |
| :--- | :--- |
| **School Director** | Overall school management, policy enforcement, and executive direction. |
| **Vice Director** | Secondary leadership, operational oversight, and departmental coordination. |
| **Dean of Students / Head Admin** | Student conduct, disciplinary escalations, and administrative staff supervision. |
| **Department Leads** | Curriculum oversight, subject scheduling, and instructional support. |

### Support & Help Tickets
If you require technical assistance, role updates, or clarification on policy, submit a ticket via the Discord `#support-tickets` channel or through the staff portal support widget. Provide clear detail regarding the issue to ensure timely resolution by the administration.

### Professional Expectations
* **Avatar & Dress Code Standards:** Wear school-compliant staff attire and maintain an appropriate, professional avatar presentation while on duty.
* **Meeting Attendance:** Attend mandatory all-staff meetings or submit a timely Leave of Absence (LOA) request prior to the scheduled session.
* **Conduct Guidelines:** Act as an exemplar of the Golden Glades Middle core values at all times, both in-game and across official Discord platforms.
